  "Description": "The Human resources scope represents NorthStar\u2019s internal workforce management. It focuses on departments, employees, managers, locations, salaries, performance reviews, bonuses, and leave requests.\n\nThis scope supports decisions about:\n\n- **Department staffing and payroll**\n- **Employee performance and compensation**\n- **Manager span of control**\n- **Team structure and location coverage**\n- **Workforce composition across offices**\n- **Leave demand and approval activity**\n\nPerformance and bonus trends over time\nThe Human resources scope provides an organizational view of the company, showing how employees are distributed, managed, compensated, evaluated, and supported.",
